# L §5.16 example, copied whole (goal, theta_mid and the source declared).  The 10 000-path asks cost minutes in
# this interpreter, so the test answers growth_q1 and one_path; L5_16_paths_small runs the path statistics.
# growth_q1: closed form (L §5.16 table) a = 1, b = 0: quantile(normal(0.03, 0.1), 0.25) correctly rounded to the
# fact's step 1e-9: printed with ≈ (its digits not asserted, L §7.3).  The row governs 2026.. and growth is read at
# its time key 2030, after the cut: held (L §8.2).
# one_path: path 512 of seed 7 prints balance_end[2040] on that path, plain (money after round), with every sample
# it reached in canonical order (L §5.16 Order: law date ascending, then id): returns[y] is read at its law date
# end_of(y) = the first day of y + 1 (L §4.2), and theta (a parameter of returns, drawn once per path) at the law date
# of its first reader, 2028-01-01; so returns[2027], theta, returns[2028], ..., returns[2040].  held (L §8.2):
# start_balance is read by balance_end[2026] at 2027-01-01, theta and vol by returns[2027..2040] at 2028-01-01 ..
# 2041-01-01, all after the cut 2026-10-20 under an open span.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2040-12-31

source own_assumption "own"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input goal: money PLN
input theta_mid: num 1/year

input growth[y in years]: dist 1/year
input theta: dist 1/year
input vol: num 1/year
input start_balance: money PLN
def returns[y in years]: dist 1/year = normal(theta, vol) to 1e-9 at end_of(y)
def balance_end[y in years]: money PLN at end_of(y)
  rule first = start_balance
  rule later beats first = round(balance_end[y - 1] * (1 + returns[y] * 1 year), minor(PLN), half-even) when pos(y) > 1

version assumptions
  cite own_assumption
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  growth[*] = normal(3 %/year, 10 %/year) to 1e-9 "planning assumption"
  theta = uniform(1 %/year, 5 %/year) to 1e-9 "own range"
  vol = 10 %/year "own guess"
  start_balance = 50 000.00 PLN "statement"

ask growth_q1: quantile(growth[2030], 25 %) law 2030-12-31
ask median_2040: quantile(balance_end[2040], 50 %) law 2040-12-31 paths 10000 seed 7
ask over_goal: share(balance_end[2040] > goal) law 2040-12-31 paths 10000 seed 7
ask bad_years: mean(balance_end[2040] where returns[2030] < 0) law 2040-12-31 paths 10000 seed 7
ask one_path: balance_end[2040] law 2040-12-31 paths 10000 seed 7 path 512
ask test_mode: mean(balance_end[2040]) with sample theta = theta_mid law 2040-12-31 paths 10000 seed 7
=== expect growth_q1 one_path
growth_q1: ≈ ...
  held: growth[2030] = normal(0.03, 0.1) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2030
  law date 2030-12-31, cut 2026-10-20
one_path: ...
  sample: returns[2027] = ...
  sample: theta = ...
  sample: returns[2028] = ...
  sample: returns[2029] = ...
  sample: returns[2030] = ...
  sample: returns[2031] = ...
  sample: returns[2032] = ...
  sample: returns[2033] = ...
  sample: returns[2034] = ...
  sample: returns[2035] = ...
  sample: returns[2036] = ...
  sample: returns[2037] = ...
  sample: returns[2038] = ...
  sample: returns[2039] = ...
  sample: returns[2040] = ...
  held: start_balance = 50 000.00 PLN (assumptions), read for 2027-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2028-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2029-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2030-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2031-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2032-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2033-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2034-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2035-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2036-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2037-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2038-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2039-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2040-01-01
  held: theta = uniform(0.01, 0.05) to 0.000000001 (assumptions), read for 2041-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2028-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2029-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2030-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2031-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2032-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2033-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2034-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2035-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2036-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2037-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2038-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2039-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2040-01-01
  held: vol = 0.1 1/year (assumptions), read for 2041-01-01
  law date 2040-12-31, cut 2026-10-20
